  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix(controller): allow Bidirectional mountPropagation on privileged containers. Fixes #3130 (cherry-pick #4789 for 1.10) by @argo-cd-cherry-pick-bot[bot] in https://github.com/argoproj/argo-rollouts/pull/5028\r\n* fix(dashboard)!: Rollouts dashboard should only bind local interface (by default) (cherry-pick #5088 for 1.10) by @argo-cd-cherry-pick-bot[bot] in https://github.com/argoproj/argo-rollouts/pull/5098\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-366v-5xmx-36vh (https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/cve-2026-82277)\r\n\r\nIf you are using a custom Helm chart or other way to expose the local Argo Rollouts dashboard you now NEED\r\nthe --address 0.0.0.0 option\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/argoproj/argo-rollouts/compare/v1.10.0...v1.10.1",
